Hi {Owner},

I build websites for electricians in and around {City}. {Business Name} does careful work going by its social pages, but there's no site a homeowner finds when they need a panel upgrade or an EV charger.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting: a request form that asks for a shot of the panel, an EV charger page, a panel upgrade explainer, a permits page and your licence and insurance shown plainly, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, then {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Ten minutes on the phone this week?

